WEBVTT

01:30.638 --> 01:33.518
<i>YG's new girl group BLACKPINK
set a new record</i>

01:33.598 --> 01:34.688
<i>by reaching number one</i>

01:34.768 --> 01:37.938
<i>in terrestrial television music programs
in just 14 days after their debut.</i>

01:38.018 --> 01:38.898
<i>There are 27 videos,</i>

01:38.978 --> 01:41.228
<i>including the music video</i>
<i>for </i>DDU-DU DDU-DU,

01:41.318 --> 01:42.898
<i>that reached</i>
<i>hundreds of millions of views…</i>

01:42.988 --> 01:44.358
<i>Setting various records…</i>

01:45.108 --> 01:46.858
<i>Surpassing the global pop stars…</i>

01:46.948 --> 01:48.238
DAY 319

01:50.368 --> 01:52.908
<i>BLACKPINK is finally</i>
<i>having their first concert in Jamsil</i>

01:52.998 --> 01:54.828
<i>in their second year since their debut…</i>

01:55.368 --> 01:57.578
-Hello, we are BLACKPINK.
-Hello, we are BLACKPINK.

01:57.668 --> 02:00.998
<i>BLACKPINK started their world tour</i>
<i>with their first concert.</i>

02:01.088 --> 02:04.338
<i>January 31, 2021,</i> <i>celebrating</i>
<i>the 5th anniversary of their debut.</i>

02:04.418 --> 02:06.628
<i>BLACKPINK is welcoming fans</i>
<i>around the world with online concerts…</i>

02:18.728 --> 02:20.688
<i>Fans around the world</i>
<i>are looking forward to seeing</i>

02:20.768 --> 02:23.988
<i>BLACKPINK in person</i>
<i>to celebrate their 5th anniversary.</i>

06:45.158 --> 06:49.748
<i>I think those were really hectic moments.</i>
<i>Because it was our first time.</i>

06:49.828 --> 06:52.628
I'm facing towards the stage right now

06:53.208 --> 06:56.378
<i>and those were the seats for BLINKS.</i>

06:57.718 --> 07:02.808
There was a stage
that stretched out to the front

07:03.508 --> 07:05.768
<i>and we ran underneath the stage.</i>

07:06.678 --> 07:10.858
<i>I think the most nervous moment is</i>
<i>when we walk towards backstage</i>

07:10.938 --> 07:13.188
<i>with the thought of meeting our fans</i>

07:13.268 --> 07:17.318
<i>and performing for them</i>
<i>I think that’s the most nervous moment.</i>

09:59.398 --> 10:02.938
<i>I feel alive when I see the fans</i>

10:03.028 --> 10:07.658
<i>singing along to my song and enjoying it.</i>

10:07.738 --> 10:11.618
<i>That feeling of success like,</i>
<i>"Wow I did it."</i>

10:11.698 --> 10:14.998
<i>They’re dancing together like me</i>

10:15.078 --> 10:18.288
<i>when I feel that</i>
<i>I think that’s when I feel most alive.</i>

10:38.938 --> 10:42.278
Wouldn’t there be much to talk about
when we meet? From now on?

10:42.358 --> 10:44.608
So, I'm looking forward to it.

11:30.528 --> 11:36.698
Performing with the band during
the concert is definitely really great.

11:36.788 --> 11:40.628
The energy is actually unreal.

12:04.648 --> 12:05.978
How do we go in here?

12:07.898 --> 12:12.198
<i>So that BLINKs can also enjoy</i>

12:12.778 --> 12:18.288
<i>the wait for our next performance.</i>

12:18.368 --> 12:19.538
<i>Please look forward to it!</i>

12:30.928 --> 12:33.798
<i>We worked really hard
to prepare for this concert</i>

12:34.048 --> 12:36.808
so I hope you watch it
more than ten times.

12:38.718 --> 12:41.308
See you soon, bye.

12:45.818 --> 12:47.818
Let's go! let's go! let's go!

12:57.828 --> 12:59.498
What are we doing right now?

13:00.368 --> 13:01.578
Emcee Girl.

13:02.998 --> 13:05.918
We got here today for the rehearsal.

13:05.998 --> 13:08.458
For what tomorrow is this rehearsal for?

13:08.548 --> 13:11.128
I believe it's a rehearsal for <i>The Show</i>.

13:49.958 --> 13:53.418
<i>I wanted to make it more perfect</i>

13:53.508 --> 13:57.928
<i>because I was not satisfied,</i>
<i>I wish I had more time…</i>

14:00.808 --> 14:01.968
<i>I’m so nervous…</i>

23:25.458 --> 23:27.708
<i>It was the most fun…</i>

23:28.708 --> 23:30.668
<i>and the best time of my life.</i>

23:33.378 --> 23:34.918
<i>I’ll continue to remember</i>

23:35.878 --> 23:37.838
<i>that moment, that feeling</i>

23:40.048 --> 23:43.258
<i>A lot of things happened,</i>
<i>there were happy times</i>

23:43.348 --> 23:45.348
<i>and there were sad times.</i>

23:45.428 --> 23:48.188
<i>I think those were the happiest times.</i>

23:59.738 --> 24:02.408
<i>When I try to think about</i>
<i>the difficult times</i>

24:02.488 --> 24:05.658
<i>I strangely can’t remember them.</i>

24:06.538 --> 24:11.328
<i>I just erase everything</i>
<i>that has to do with difficult times</i>

24:11.418 --> 24:12.838
<i>without even knowing from my mind</i>

24:13.038 --> 24:16.208
<i>I don’t think I’m over positive</i>
<i>and outgoing person.</i>

24:16.298 --> 24:18.548
<i>I am normal person just like everyone else</i>

24:18.628 --> 24:20.678
<i>every day I’m like this.</i>

24:32.268 --> 24:37.318
<i>I knew what I wanted to do</i>
<i>since I was young</i>

24:37.398 --> 24:40.988
<i>I believe I am very lucky person.</i>

24:41.528 --> 24:45.238
<i>I had a clear goal</i>
<i>to be a singer in the future.</i>

24:45.328 --> 24:48.578
<i>I worked hard to make my dream come true.</i>

24:59.968 --> 25:02.468
<i>I try to think that I am happy without</i>

25:03.178 --> 25:07.468
<i>having to stress myself too much.</i>

25:07.558 --> 25:11.888
<i>I hope for the others to think like that.</i>

36:57.928 --> 37:02.518
<i>I think I thought that I am</i>
<i>a lot stronger than I thought.</i>

37:05.268 --> 37:08.818
<i>There will be times when I feel hurt</i>

37:09.278 --> 37:12.568
<i>or go through hardship but</i>

37:12.658 --> 37:15.408
<i>during those times my way of overcoming</i>

37:15.488 --> 37:18.408
<i>is preparing more for this</i>

37:18.498 --> 37:20.918
<i>or focusing on thinking about</i>
<i>how I can better move forward.</i>

37:50.738 --> 37:51.738
<i>Attitude towards life?</i>

37:55.618 --> 37:57.158
<i>That’s a hard one.</i>

37:58.198 --> 37:59.748
<i>Well…</i>

38:01.708 --> 38:04.998
<i>I think I just live</i>
<i>by enjoying every moment.</i>

38:35.908 --> 38:37.988
<i>What I felt throughout the process is</i>

38:38.078 --> 38:42.118
<i>that if I think too far ahead about</i>

38:42.208 --> 38:44.118
<i>things that haven’t happened yet</i>

38:44.208 --> 38:45.878
<i>I could get anxious and worry about it</i>

38:45.958 --> 38:47.918
<i>and there are many things I overlook.</i>

38:47.998 --> 38:50.758
<i>So I try to live in the moment</i>

38:50.838 --> 38:54.968
<i>and try to have fun, I think.</i>

39:09.518 --> 39:12.608
<i>It's almost time to meet all the BLINKs</i>

39:12.688 --> 39:15.738
<i>from all over the world</i>
<i>who have waited so long.</i>

39:15.818 --> 39:20.618
<i>I am very, very nervous</i>
<i>but as much as you’ve waited</i>

39:20.988 --> 39:22.498
<i>I am going to show you the best.</i>

39:22.578 --> 39:24.458
<i>Show us a lot of support and enjoy it.</i>

39:35.758 --> 39:39.348
Thailand is also Lisa's hometown

39:39.428 --> 39:45.268
I think it's more meaningful to start
our world tour in Lisa's hometown.

39:45.348 --> 39:50.518
Starting from Thailand,
we're going to North America

39:50.608 --> 39:54.528
and Europe
to meet BLINKs around the world.

39:54.608 --> 39:57.408
I'm so honored and looking forward to it.

40:04.868 --> 40:10.168
<i>BLACKPINK's world tour itself</i>
<i>is still very unfamiliar to me.</i>

40:10.248 --> 40:13.208
I still can't believe it.

40:17.588 --> 40:21.598
I prepared a lot of fun stuff
for our concert

40:22.098 --> 40:25.558
and want to do more exciting things
in different countries.

40:25.638 --> 40:27.938
That's how I feel.

40:28.018 --> 40:33.108
I hope many BLINKs around the world come.
It's gonna be fun.

41:23.948 --> 41:25.948
It was very touching.

41:26.038 --> 41:30.248
I think I'm very lucky to see them,
I could really tell how hard they tried.

41:30.328 --> 41:35.798
<i>From beginning to end
I want them to take care of themselves.</i>

41:35.878 --> 41:39.718
I hope everyone is healthy because

41:39.798 --> 41:43.928
<i>they have to go to concerts
around the world.</i>

42:02.778 --> 42:07.078
<i>We're going</i>
<i>to visit BLINKs in other countries</i>

42:07.158 --> 42:09.328
<i>Please wait a little more.</i>

42:09.408 --> 42:12.998
We'll be there very soon
and we'll show you a great performance.

42:13.078 --> 42:14.958
Wait a little bit BLINKs.

43:48.548 --> 43:53.888
I just love how four young women
be themselves.

45:13.428 --> 45:14.718
Hello, I’m Lisa.

45:54.138 --> 45:57.348
I’m a little shy

45:57.428 --> 46:01.478
but I want to tell everyone…

46:05.018 --> 46:06.318
Thank you so much.

01:01:47.378 --> 01:01:51.218
<i>I think our identity is rather fixed</i>

01:01:51.718 --> 01:01:53.598
<i>I like to think that</i>

01:01:53.678 --> 01:01:57.268
<i>we have a lot of pride</i>
<i>in having color black and pink</i>

01:01:57.348 --> 01:01:58.808
but because of that

01:01:58.888 --> 01:02:02.938
we’re still in the process
of continuously experimenting

01:02:03.018 --> 01:02:06.688
<i>and fortunately rather than</i>
<i>not being able to predict it,</i>

01:02:06.778 --> 01:02:10.948
<i>we are going forward in the direction that</i>
<i>we want</i>

01:02:11.028 --> 01:02:14.368
and just enjoying the whole process
because of that.

01:02:14.448 --> 01:02:16.038
<i>We all grew up in different cultures</i>

01:02:16.118 --> 01:02:18.538
<i>and various cultures overlapped
and a group was born.</i>

01:02:19.578 --> 01:02:21.578
But instead of forcing them into one

01:02:21.668 --> 01:02:25.338
we worked as a group

01:02:25.418 --> 01:02:27.798
without losing each of our individuality

01:02:27.878 --> 01:02:32.548
<i>and I think that rather emerged
as the color of the group BLACKPINK.</i>

01:02:33.468 --> 01:02:37.808
I think we shine the brightest

01:02:37.888 --> 01:02:40.098
when we do what we love to do.

01:02:40.178 --> 01:02:42.648
Now that’d be music, right?

01:02:42.728 --> 01:02:47.608
When we are fully expressing
what we want to express.

01:02:48.228 --> 01:02:51.398
That’s when we shine the brightest.

01:02:51.488 --> 01:02:54.868
<i>So I think it’d be great for us to show</i>

01:02:54.948 --> 01:02:59.328
a lot of things
that we enjoy doing in the future.

01:02:59.408 --> 01:03:02.498
<i>As we do this,</i>
<i>because we’ve always done it thinking,</i>

01:03:02.578 --> 01:03:07.208
<i>"We could show something like this,</i>
<i>this time we can show this."</i>

01:03:07.838 --> 01:03:11.838
<i>I think we can show different sides</i>
<i>of us now onwards too.</i>

01:03:12.718 --> 01:03:17.848
We plan on continuing to do what we want
and show it.

01:03:22.228 --> 01:03:26.858
Five years is not too short and not too
long of a time, right?

01:03:27.478 --> 01:03:31.318
<i>But a lot of different things happened.</i>

01:03:31.898 --> 01:03:34.908
<i>There were happy times, and sad times.</i>

01:03:35.778 --> 01:03:42.708
<i>I think those</i>
<i>were the happiest times in my 20s.</i>

01:03:45.748 --> 01:03:48.998
<i>When we were on tour</i>

01:03:49.088 --> 01:03:53.088
<i>I’d always feel hectic thinking about</i>

01:03:53.168 --> 01:03:56.468
<i>which city we have to go next and such.</i>

01:03:57.048 --> 01:04:01.308
But then seeing this video
it seems like we laughed a lot

01:04:01.388 --> 01:04:06.398
<i>and really enjoyed our time together.</i>

01:04:08.108 --> 01:04:12.818
When we debuted,
and had different experiences

01:04:13.398 --> 01:04:16.858
<i>there was a fear about whether</i>
<i>or not we were doing well</i>

01:04:16.948 --> 01:04:20.408
<i>and felt uncertain about some things.</i>

01:04:21.038 --> 01:04:23.158
<i>When we had our first concert</i>

01:04:23.908 --> 01:04:29.918
what we say on stage is
also a very important part of our concert.

01:04:29.998 --> 01:04:34.918
I was really nervous, like,
"Let’s not make any mistake."

01:04:35.128 --> 01:04:39.798
It’s already been two years
since we debuted a little more than that.

01:04:39.888 --> 01:04:43.848
And to be able to have a concert

01:04:43.928 --> 01:04:48.648
at such a big venue in Korea
in Seoul like this…

01:04:48.728 --> 01:04:52.978
Even as I’m saying it I feel like
I’ve improved very very much.

01:04:53.068 --> 01:04:56.398
And that was possible thanks to BLINKs.
Right, everyone?

01:04:56.488 --> 01:04:59.738
We’ve been together since day one.

01:04:59.818 --> 01:05:04.618
I like to think that
we’ve grown a little bit

01:05:04.698 --> 01:05:08.078
seeing how we’ve become
more comfortable with making a speech

01:05:08.168 --> 01:05:09.458
<i>and taking care of each other.</i>

01:05:09.538 --> 01:05:12.748
<i>I like to believe that</i>

01:05:12.838 --> 01:05:15.588
we still have that energy
from when we were trainees.

01:05:17.508 --> 01:05:20.968
I’m so moved,
thank you all so much for coming.

01:05:21.548 --> 01:05:25.428
<i>Because it’s the four of us
let’s trust the four of us</i>

01:05:25.518 --> 01:05:30.398
<i>and have more fun since we started saying</i>
<i>that often.</i>

01:05:30.478 --> 01:05:34.478
It became more enjoyable
to take on new challenges

01:05:34.568 --> 01:05:38.068
and we got more excited
and looked forward to things?

01:05:38.148 --> 01:05:40.358
I think we grew further.

01:05:40.448 --> 01:05:46.698
We are always here for you, BLINKs,
so please stay with us BLINKs.

01:05:47.618 --> 01:05:49.208
When the four of us are together

01:05:49.288 --> 01:05:54.048
we always laugh and talk
just like we did when we were trainees.

01:05:54.128 --> 01:05:56.878
It’s just so fun to work together also.

01:05:56.958 --> 01:05:59.128
I think we’re the same.

01:06:00.218 --> 01:06:02.508
Now we don’t even have to say a word

01:06:02.598 --> 01:06:05.598
we just look at
each other’s eyes and know.

01:06:07.598 --> 01:06:09.098
Tell us, Lisa.

01:06:09.188 --> 01:06:13.398
Yes. Thanks to all of your support.

01:06:14.648 --> 01:06:18.068
And your love I will strive to work harder

01:06:18.148 --> 01:06:20.568
as Lisa of BLACKPINK, everyone.

01:06:20.658 --> 01:06:21.948
I love you, BLINKs.

01:16:41.228 --> 01:16:42.898
<i>BLINKs.</i>

01:16:43.608 --> 01:16:49.028
We just finished the last US show, yay.

01:16:49.528 --> 01:16:51.618
Wow, I still can’t hear.

01:16:52.948 --> 01:16:54.208
Is my voice coming out alright?

01:16:54.288 --> 01:16:57.418
I’m so sad it’s already over.

01:16:57.498 --> 01:17:03.758
It feels bittersweet.

01:17:05.548 --> 01:17:07.218
Over the past month and a half

01:17:08.008 --> 01:17:12.638
there were
many new and exciting experiences.

01:17:12.718 --> 01:17:17.898
Still, I had a lot of time
to relax in different cities.

01:17:19.978 --> 01:17:21.268
And it was great.

01:17:22.648 --> 01:17:26.948
<i>We performed a lot</i>
<i>and it was a meaningful time.</i>

01:17:27.448 --> 01:17:31.738
<i>I think I enjoyed every moment
more than I thought.</i>

01:17:31.828 --> 01:17:34.998
<i>It was a meaningful tour,</i>
<i>like a surprise gift.</i>

01:17:35.908 --> 01:17:38.828
<i>What I felt the most</i>
<i>during the tour was that…</i>

01:17:42.298 --> 01:17:44.588
<i>it was really a time for me</i>

01:17:44.668 --> 01:17:48.218
<i>to rethink myself as BLACKPINK.</i>

01:17:56.598 --> 01:18:01.858
I honestly don’t think we’ve changed much
just because it’s been five years.

01:18:01.938 --> 01:18:04.438
<i>We haven’t changed much,</i>

01:18:04.528 --> 01:18:07.608
<i>but it’s more reassuring</i>
<i>to have fans by our side</i>

01:18:07.698 --> 01:18:11.238
<i>that always support us for five years.</i>

01:18:11.318 --> 01:18:14.288
There will be sixth
and seventh anniversary in the future

01:18:14.368 --> 01:18:19.998
but because it feels like
we’re getting stronger over the years

01:18:20.078 --> 01:18:24.798
I really like the feeling of us and BLINKs

01:18:24.878 --> 01:18:26.918
becoming a lot closer.

01:19:26.568 --> 01:19:31.448
<i>I feel like I cried a lot</i>
<i>over the five years.</i>

01:19:31.528 --> 01:19:36.278
<i>When I watch the videos</i>
<i>from my fans I tear up.</i>

01:19:36.368 --> 01:19:40.288
I was so touched
when I just saw that video.

01:19:40.368 --> 01:19:43.998
Even now as I’m talking
I feel like I’m going to cry.

01:19:44.078 --> 01:19:48.878
Because I think those were
such happy times.

01:20:01.388 --> 01:20:05.268
<i>Five years ago we were five years younger</i>

01:20:05.348 --> 01:20:08.148
and it was probably the same
with our BLINKs.

01:20:08.228 --> 01:20:10.228
As we keep growing

01:20:10.318 --> 01:20:14.358
I was very very happy
to be able to be with BLINKs

01:20:14.448 --> 01:20:18.738
<i>and I miss them so much since we haven’t</i>
<i>been able to meet lately</i>

01:20:18.828 --> 01:20:22.708
<i>but just as much, next time we all meet</i>

01:20:22.788 --> 01:20:24.998
<i>I’m so excited at the thought</i>

01:20:25.078 --> 01:20:29.048
<i>that we’ll be able</i>
<i>to really happily greet them.</i>

01:20:29.128 --> 01:20:35.008
Thank you so much
for always worrying about us

01:20:35.088 --> 01:20:37.138
and we miss you so much.

01:20:37.718 --> 01:20:41.268
<i>Because BLINKs are always there</i>

01:20:41.348 --> 01:20:43.638
by our side loving us
no matter what we did

01:20:43.728 --> 01:20:47.608
or happened that year.

01:20:48.058 --> 01:20:52.398
It makes us want to further move forward

01:20:52.488 --> 01:20:55.948
I hope you go
all the way together with BLACKPINK

01:20:56.028 --> 01:21:01.038
as lifelong companions.

01:21:01.118 --> 01:21:04.078
Thank you and love you always.

01:21:06.368 --> 01:21:12.458
When we talk about how we feel inside

01:21:12.548 --> 01:21:14.128
I always have nothing to say

01:21:14.218 --> 01:21:16.338
I feel very shy about it but…

01:21:28.518 --> 01:21:29.728
What should I say?

01:21:40.528 --> 01:21:43.238
To keep it short

01:21:47.788 --> 01:21:50.288
Thank you so much.

01:21:50.378 --> 01:21:56.838
Thank you so much
for loving BLACKPINK Lisa.

01:21:56.918 --> 01:21:59.888
When I was a kid I never imagined…

01:22:01.638 --> 01:22:04.178
I could be loved

01:22:05.348 --> 01:22:11.478
by people all over the world.

01:22:20.448 --> 01:22:26.948
I don't know how to express
my feelings other than thank you.

01:23:24.008 --> 01:23:26.468
<i>As we go up the stage like this</i>

01:23:26.558 --> 01:23:31.478
<i>we can see</i>
<i>the light sticks shaking and the cheering.</i>

01:23:33.728 --> 01:23:35.688
<i>It’s so pretty.</i>

01:23:36.648 --> 01:23:39.818
<i>Some people make it go beep beep beep</i>

01:23:39.898 --> 01:23:41.948
<i>because you can set it like that.</i>

01:23:42.028 --> 01:23:46.618
<i>Every time I hear it I just get so excited</i>
<i>and feel so encouraged.</i>

01:23:49.868 --> 01:23:53.708
-BLACKPINK!
-BLACKPINK!

01:23:53.788 --> 01:23:57.588
-BLACKPINK!
-BLACKPINK!

01:23:57.668 --> 01:23:59.958
-BLACKPINK!
-BLACKPINK!

01:24:00.048 --> 01:24:03.258
We’ll cherish this truly precious memory.

01:24:03.338 --> 01:24:07.218
Thanks to all of you supporting
and loving us wholeheartedly.

01:24:07.718 --> 01:24:12.268
We’ll keep this memory
and strive to grow further as BLACKPINK.

